## 9. Student Profile — What Must Be Filled and Why

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Required for profileCompleted=True
        N[name] 
        U[university] 
        C[college]
        D[degree]
        M[major]
        I[industry]
    end

    subgraph Optional but used in report
        DP[department text\ncourse semester]
        AD[academicDepartment ref\nDepartment model]
        RN[rollNumber]
        EN[enrollmentNumber]
        SN[supervisorName]
        SC[supervisorContact]
        UL[universityLogoOverride]
        CL[collegeLogoOverride]
    end

    profileCompleted -->|unlocks| CreateReport[Create Report page]
```

**Profile Update Endpoints (3 separate PUT calls):**
- `PUT /api/student/profile/personal` → name, address, phone, gender
- `PUT /api/student/profile/college` → university, college, degree, department, major, semester, rollNumber, enrollmentNumber
- `PUT /api/student/profile/industry` → industry, supervisor details, optional custom overrides

