## 10. Logo System — Where Logos Come From in PDF

The PDF cover page can show up to 4 logos. Here's the resolution logic:

```mermaid
graph TD
    A{Does editedContent.__cover.logos\nexist with custom logo URLs?}
    A -->|YES| B[Use custom logos array\nup to logoCount]
    A -->|NO| C[Build fallback logos]
    C --> D[universityLogoOverride\nOR university.logo\nOR report.university.logo]
    C --> E[collegeLogoOverride\nOR college.logo\nOR report.college.logo]
    C --> F[industry.logo]
    D --> G[Final logos list sent to PDF template]
    E --> G
    F --> G

    style B fill:#27ae60,color:#fff
    style G fill:#2980b9,color:#fff
```

