## 11. Admin Approval Workflow — For Student-Submitted Entities

Students can submit new Universities, Colleges, Departments, Majors, and Industries. These need admin approval.

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : Student creates entity
    pending --> approved : Admin clicks Approve
    pending --> rejected : Admin clicks Reject (with reason)
    rejected --> pending : Student can see rejection reason\nbut cannot resubmit automatically
    approved --> [*]

    note right of pending
        Visible to: 
        - The student who created it
        - Not visible to other students
    end note

    note right of approved
        Visible to:
        - All students
        - Can be used in reports
    end note
```

**Visibility rule in code:**
```python
def _is_visible_to_student(doc, current_user):
    return (approvalStatus == 'approved') OR (createdBy == current_user.id)
```

