## 12. Report Template Hierarchy — Admin Configuration Guide

Here's how an admin should configure sections for a university:

```
SCENARIO: GTU University, Computer Engineering Department, B.Tech Major

Step 1: Admin sets UniversityReportTemplate for GTU
  → 7 standard sections for all GTU students

Step 2: (Optional) Admin sets CollegeReportTemplate for specific college
  → useUniversityDefault=False + custom sections
  → Override only for that college's students

Step 3: (Optional) Admin sets MajorReportTemplate for B.Tech CS
  → useLevelAboveDefault=False + custom sections
  → Override specifically for CS students

Result: CS student at GTU-affiliated college
  → Gets MajorReportTemplate sections (most specific wins)
```

