## 13. InternshipType — Legacy System (Mostly Unused)

`InternshipType` was the **original** way to configure report sections. It has:
- `name` (e.g. "Software Development Internship")
- `description`
- `aiPromptContext`
- `reportSections` (embedded list of `InternshipTypeSection`)

**Current status:** This model exists and is managed by admins at `/admin/types`, but it is **NOT used** in the current report generation flow. The flow uses `Major.reportLanguage/reportContentType/aiPromptContext/reportPolicy/reportSections` directly.

> [!WARNING]
> `InternshipType` is a dead-end in the current system. Its sections are never sent to n8n in the current flow. Either:
> 1. Remove it and clean up the UI, OR
> 2. Integrate it — e.g., let Major reference an InternshipType to inherit its sections and aiPromptContext

