## 19. Complete Flow Summary — From Zero to PDF

```mermaid
graph TD
    REG[1. Student Registers] --> PROF[2. Student fills Profile\nuniversity, college, degree\ndepartment, major, industry]
    PROF -->|profileCompleted=True| CREATE[3. Go to Create Report page]
    
    CREATE --> SEL[4. Degree + Department + Major selected\nfrom profile OR changed]
    SEL --> PT[5. Pick or type Project Title\noptional: from ProjectTitle suggestions]
    PT --> KW[6. Select Work Keywords\nfiltered by industryType + jobProfile]
    KW --> DESC[7. Write brief description\nOR let keywords auto-fill]
    DESC --> SUBMIT[8. Submit → POST /api/reports/]
    
    SUBMIT --> CASCADE[Backend resolves sections\nMajor→College→University cascade]
    CASCADE --> PAYLOAD[Build full AI payload]
    PAYLOAD --> N8N[Send to n8n webhook]
    
    N8N --> SPLIT[n8n: Split into one item per section]
    SPLIT --> GPT[n8n: GPT-4.1 generates each section\nwith full context + formatting rules]
    GPT --> MERGE[n8n: Merge all sections\n+ duplicate sentence check]
    MERGE --> CALLBACK[n8n: PUT callback to Flask]
    
    CALLBACK --> SAVE[Flask saves generatedContent\nstatus = generated]
    SAVE --> POLL[Student polls for status=generated]
    POLL --> VIEW[Student views report sections]
    VIEW --> EDIT[Student edits any section]
    EDIT --> EDITSTATUS[status = edited]
    EDITSTATUS --> IMAGE[Student uploads images\nper section, with position: top/middle/bottom]
    IMAGE --> PDF[Download PDF via Playwright]

    style REG fill:#3498db,color:#fff
    style SUBMIT fill:#e67e22,color:#fff
    style N8N fill:#8e44ad,color:#fff
    style GPT fill:#c0392b,color:#fff
    style CALLBACK fill:#8e44ad,color:#fff
    style PDF fill:#27ae60,color:#fff
```

---

## 20. Quick Reference — What Controls What

| If you want to control... | Change this... |
|--------------------------|----------------|
| What language report is written in | `Major.reportLanguage` |
| What sections appear in report | `MajorReportTemplate` → `sections[]` |
| How many words per section | Hardcoded in n8n (280-420 words) |
| AI writing style/format | `Major.reportPolicy.generationInstruction` |
| Whether tables are allowed | `Major.reportContentType` (include "table") |
| Whether images can be uploaded | `Major.reportPolicy.imagesRequired` |
| AI domain context | `Major.aiPromptContext` |
| Report pricing | `Service.price` + `Service.degreePricing` |
| Which students can use a section template | Assign college/major template appropriately |
| Work keywords shown to student | `WorkKeyword.industryType` + `jobProfile` |
| PDF cover page content | Student edits `editedContent.__cover` + `__coverPage` |
| PDF header/footer text | `editedContent.__layout` |

